00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,360
of what is a thorough treatment of the subject

239
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:16,360
for what's in the Scout Handbook.

240
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:18,360
Go with the Scout Handbook,

241
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:20,360
Stick with the program. that's right there.

242
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,360
The next one that you need to read cover to cover

