00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:28,360
It has lots of information and good advice,

246
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:30,360
and I want you to read it very carefully.

247
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:32,360
Take a look through it, take these things to heart.

248
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:34,360
It really means what it says

249
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,360
And it's a great resource.

